# Tests required

Changes to refund policy, order matching, or graph routing need pytest coverage. Tests must not call xAI or Voyage.

Assert outcomes, rule ids, and tool calls. Do not assert exact assistant wording.

```bash
# CI
python3 -m pytest

# Opt-in, real model, not collected by pytest
python3 -m evals.run
```

Put the eval script under `evals/`, not `tests/`. A new refund branch needs a table-driven case, including the boundary on each side of the limit.
